Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Fix reference-photo cache staleness and surface
 trip-tracking permission denial

Reference photos: re-uploading overwrote the same storage path, but the
signed-URL query cache was keyed by that same unchanged path, so the app
kept showing the old photo indefinitely. Bust that cache on upload.

Trip tracking: useAutoTripTracking's permission result was discarded, so
a denied background-location permission (common on Android 11+, which
requires a separate "Allow all the time" step) silently disabled both
trip auto-start and live-location reporting with zero indication why.
Surface it as an actionable banner on the driver Home screen.
